00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:27.380
oh, gotta play that one instead of, say, Galaga.

00:14:27.740 --> 00:14:39.640
I mean, so a part of it is I actually don't know how far back we have to go to get to a designed-for-home console game.

00:14:39.640 --> 00:14:41.980
