00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:53.860
Yeah, I was just going to say Kid Icarus.

00:14:54.640 --> 00:14:56.820
Oh, no, Rygar was arcade.

00:14:57.180 --> 00:14:59.360
Oh, it was? Yeah, Rygar was arcade.

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:00.660
Different game, though.

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:04.440
Okay. In the doldrums, I don't know how long this is going to go.

00:15:04.560 --> 00:15:05.540
Actually, I do.

00:15:05.760 --> 00:15:13.480
